We talk about Brotherhood

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:35.300
you have to work for it you've got a hunger for it

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:37.440
you've got a lunge, die and bleed for it

00:01:39.640 --> 00:01:41.640
Welcome to hell

